cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use edgar-eval or S-1 Bench, please cite it as below."
title: "edgar-eval: S-1 Bench and skills for verifiable AI analysis of SEC filings"
abstract: >-
  A self-validating benchmark of 47 quote-anchored questions over Anthropic, PBC's Form S-1,
  and two agent skills: filing-factsheet, which builds a compact page-cited fact sheet so a
  model that fits a 24GB GPU can answer filing questions, and filing-evals, which builds,
  validates, and scores such benchmarks with code-based checks including quote grounding.
type: software
authors:
